Initialize local Axon config, env, and compose assets

Usage
  axon setup init [OPTIONS]

Options
  --mcp-host <MCP_HOST>            MCP HTTP bind host written to AXON_HTTP_HOST
  --mcp-port <MCP_PORT>            MCP HTTP bind port written to AXON_HTTP_PORT
  --auth-mode <AUTH_MODE>          MCP auth mode. Bearer generates/requires AXON_HTTP_TOKEN; OAuth requires Google OAuth vars Possible values: bearer, oauth
  --mcp-token <MCP_TOKEN>          Static bearer token for AXON_HTTP_TOKEN
  --oauth-public-url <OAUTH_PUBLIC_URL>
                                   Public URL for OAuth metadata and callbacks
  --google-client-id <GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID>
                                   Google OAuth client ID
  --google-client-secret <GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET>
                                   Google OAuth client secret
  --auth-admin-email <AUTH_ADMIN_EMAIL>
                                   Admin email allowed to complete OAuth auth
  --tavily-api-key <TAVILY_API_KEY>
                                   Tavily API key for search/research
  --github-token <GITHUB_TOKEN>    GitHub token for higher-rate GitHub ingest
  --reddit-client-id <REDDIT_CLIENT_ID>
                                   Reddit client ID for Reddit ingest
  --reddit-client-secret <REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET>
                                   Reddit client secret for Reddit ingest
  --json                           Output results as machine-readable JSON
  --color <COLOR>                  Color output: auto (TTY detect, default), always, never Possible values: auto, always, never
  --motion <MOTION>                Terminal motion: auto (interactive TTY outside CI), always, never Possible values: auto, always, never
  -v, --verbose                    Show operator diagnostics; repeat for debug detail (-vv)
  --quiet                          Suppress spinners and progress output (useful in scripts). JSON data is unaffected
  -h, --help                       Print help
